<title>USA: New York physical copper market - June 2.</title>
<headline>New York physical copper market - June 2.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Based on COMEX settlement prices, merchant copper cathodes for June shipment were quoted at a nominal 119.75 to 120.50 cents a lb.</p>
<p>Dealers quoted No.2 scrap copper at a nominal 98.50 cents per lb, unchanged from May 30th.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
